<title>HUNGARY: C.Europe's CESI index eases 6.90 points.</title>
<headline>C.Europe's CESI index eases 6.90 points.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index eased on Tuesday to close at 1,394.74 points, down 6.90 points or 0.49 percent, the Budapest Stock Stock Exchange said on its Reuters page.</p>
<p>The index, which has been published since February 1, reflect trends of 73 shares on the Budapest, Prague, Warsaw, Bratislava and Ljubljana bourses.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327-4040</p>
</text>
